  "changelog": "Initial release.\n\n- Slices rasters into multi-zoom XYZ Web Mercator PNG tiles with per-tile metadata.\n- Generates tiles using pure Python PNG encoding (no PIL/GDAL dependency, offline-ready).\n- Supports both local GeoTIFF rasters and synthetic gradient raster generation.\n- Outputs organized `{z}/{x}/{y}.png` directories, with accompanying tiles.json and output-manifest.json.\n- Includes command line options for bounding box, zoom range, tile size, and quiet mode.\n- Runs fully offline, preserving user privacy.",
